        "original_id": "d1a76d40-130b-5a11-a729-fe9264fa5d07",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Lightfoot, Ivan Milat, Bradley Murdoch, Rupert Glasson\n- Films: Wolf Creek, Rogue, Coffin Rock\n- Topics: horror films, film marketing, true-crime inspirations\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1990s, Ivan Milat committed real-life murders of tourists that later echoed elements of the plot of Wolf Creek.\n- In 2001, Bradley Murdoch committed a real-life murder case that later echoed elements of the plot of Wolf Creek.\n- Wolf Creek was ambiguously marketed as being based on true events.\n- Wolf Creek drew plot elements reminiscent of the tourist murders associated with Ivan Milat and Bradley Murdoch.\n- David Lightfoot worked on the horror films Wolf Creek and Rogue.\n- Coffin Rock is an Australian melodramatic thriller film.\n- Rupert Glasson directed Coffin Rock.\n- David Lightfoot produced Coffin Rock.",
